Section: misc
Priority: optional
Multi-Arch: foreign
Homepage: https://github.com/h3nc4/Dreamweaver
Depends: dreamweaver-apt-source (= @VERSION@), dreamweaver-branding (= @VERSION@)
Description: Dreamweaver system identity
 Makes the system identify as Dreamweaver: os-release, the login banners in
 /etc/issue and /etc/issue.net, and the GRUB distributor name and boot menu.
 .
 The base-files originals are diverted rather than replaced, so removing this
 package restores them.
